      "abstract": "AUTH-001 evidence for 127.0.0.1:8787",
      "content": "Observation: An unauthenticated initialize succeeded (HTTP 200) and 4 tools were enumerated.\nInference: Tools with high-impact capability are reachable without a credential: send_email.\nRecommendation: If this endpoint is not intentionally public, require OAuth 2.1 per the MCP authorization specification and return 401 with a WWW-Authenticate challenge on unauthenticated requests.\nLimitations: Only the unauthenticated surface was observed. Behaviour behind the login boundary is unknown. | Intent is not observable: a public endpoint may be a deliberate choice.\nEvidence: POST http://127.0.0.1:8787/mcp → 200 | initialize → result",
      "object_refs": [
